## Develop

```
keystone-plugin test    # validate manifest + run go test ./...
keystone-plugin build   # produce bin/{{.Name}}-plugin
keystone-plugin publish # pack into {{.Name}}-<version>.tgz
```

## Install locally

Drop the built binary and `plugin.yaml` into keystone's `-plugins-dir`,
then `POST /plugins/{{.Name}}/enable`.

## Contract

The plugin implements `ports.Adapter` — see
`internal/{{.Name}}/adapter.go`. Everything else (wire, event pump,
progress) is the SDK's problem.
